#: ../../reference/config.rst:4
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:6
msgid ""
"A node reads its configuration from ``config.json`` in its data "
"directory. A hub reads command-line flags and, for federation, "
"``federation.json`` in its data directory. This page lists every key, its"
" default and the way to change it."
msgstr ""
"节点从其数据目录中的 ``config.json`` 读取配置。hub 读取命令行标志，联邦功能则读取其数据目录中的 "
"``federation.json``\\ 。本页列出所有配置键、它们的默认值和修改方式。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:10
msgid ""
"The configuration has few keys on purpose. A key exists only when someone"
" needs a value other than the default and the value cannot be derived "
"from other information. Internal timings, limits that form a security "
"boundary and the location of files inside the data directory are "
"constants and not settings."
msgstr "配置键有意保持很少。只有当某人需要默认值以外的值，且该值无法由其他信息推得时，才会有对应的键。内部时序、构成安全边界的限制，以及数据目录内各文件的位置，都是常量，而不是设置。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:21
msgid "How the configuration is changed"
msgstr "配置的修改方式"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:23
msgid ""
"``anet init`` writes the defaults and never changes a value that is "
"already set. Three rules govern the entry points."
msgstr "``anet init`` 写入默认值，且不会更改已设置的值。三条规则适用于各个入口。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:26
msgid ""
"A key that changes trust, spending or identity is changed only through "
"the command line, and the command asks for confirmation on the terminal. "
"Without a terminal it refuses with ``tty_required``."
msgstr "改变信任、支出或身份的键只能通过命令行修改，且命令会在终端上请求确认。没有终端时，命令以 ``tty_required`` 拒绝。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:29
msgid ""
"Every other key is edited in ``config.json``. The daemon reads the file "
"when it starts, so a change takes effect after a restart. A key that has "
"a command takes effect at once when it is set through that command."
msgstr "其他键都在 ``config.json`` 中编辑。守护进程在启动时读取该文件，因此修改在重启后生效。有对应命令的键，通过该命令设置时立即生效。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:32
msgid "The MCP tools never change the configuration."
msgstr "MCP 工具从不修改配置。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:34
msgid ""
"The daemon refuses to start when ``config.json`` contains a removed key, "
"and prints the sentence ``config_key_removed`` with the replacement (:ref"
":`reference-config-removed`). It also refuses to start when a value fails"
" validation (``config_invalid``). ``anet doctor`` reports removed keys "
"under ``config.removed`` before the daemon is started."
msgstr ""
"``config.json`` 含有已移除的键时，守护进程拒绝启动，并输出语句 ``config_key_removed`` 及替代方式（:ref"
":`reference-config-removed`）。值未通过校验时（``config_invalid``），守护进程同样拒绝启动。\\ "
"``anet doctor`` 会在守护进程启动之前，在 ``config.removed`` 下报告已移除的键。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:45
msgid ""
"A complete minimal ``config.json`` after a join looks as follows. Keys "
"that have their default value need not appear."
msgstr "加入 hub 之后，一份完整的最小 ``config.json`` 如下所示。取默认值的键无需出现。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:60
msgid ""
"The port in ``control_addr`` is an example. ``anet id new`` assigns a "
"free port."
msgstr "``control_addr`` 中的端口仅为示例。\\ ``anet id new`` 会分配一个空闲端口。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:64
msgid "Top-level keys"
msgstr "顶层键"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:66
msgid "``control_addr``"
msgstr "``control_addr``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:67
msgid ""
"Default: ``127.0.0.1:<assigned>``. The listen address of the control "
"plane. It differs per identity so that several identities coexist on one "
"machine. It is written by ``anet id new`` and rarely edited."
msgstr ""
"默认值：``127.0.0.1:<assigned>``\\ 。控制平面的监听地址。它随身份而异，使得多个身份可以共存于一台机器。它由 "
"``anet id new`` 写入，很少需要编辑。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:71
msgid "``hub_url``"
msgstr "``hub_url``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:72
msgid ""
"Default: empty. The hub of the node. It is written only by ``anet hub-"
"register``."
msgstr "默认值：空。节点所属的 hub。仅由 ``anet hub-register`` 写入。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:74
msgid "``name``, ``caps``"
msgstr "``name``, ``caps``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:75
msgid ""
"Default: empty. The display name and the capability tags that the "
"directory shows. Set with ``anet hub-register --name`` and ``--caps``."
msgstr "默认值：空。目录中显示的显示名称和能力标签。通过 ``anet hub-register --name`` 和 ``--caps`` 设置。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:78
msgid "``summary``, ``readme``"
msgstr "``summary``, ``readme``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:79
msgid ""
"Default: empty. The self-description of the agent. Set with ``anet "
"profile set``."
msgstr "默认值：空。agent 的自我描述。通过 ``anet profile set`` 设置。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:81
msgid "``no_response_after``"
msgstr "``no_response_after``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:82
msgid ""
"Default: ``\"15m\"``. One value governs two limits: how long a delegation"
" may stay unconfirmed before it fails with ``delivery_unconfirmed``, and "
"how long, after the other node confirmed it, the other side may stay "
"silent before the task ends with ``no_response``. Long tasks need a "
"larger value. The value ``\"0\"`` waits for the full message lifetime of "
"14 days. Valid values are a Go duration or ``\"0\"``. The delivery line "
"of a task names the time at which the node gives up."
msgstr ""
"默认值：``\"15m\"``\\ 。一个值决定两项限制：委派在以 ``delivery_unconfirmed`` "
"失败之前可以保持未确认多久，以及对方节点确认之后，对方可以沉默多久，任务才以 ``no_response`` 结束。耗时较长的任务需要更大的值。值"
" ``\"0\"`` 表示等待完整的 14 天消息生存期。有效值为 Go 时长或 ``\"0\"``\\ 。任务的投递行会指出节点放弃的时间。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:90
msgid "``stream_preview``"
msgstr "``stream_preview``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:91
msgid ""
"Default: ``\"off\"``. Whether this node sends previews as a provider. The"
" values are ``off``, ``on`` and ``with_reasoning``. Set with ``anet "
"preview``; ``with_reasoning`` needs terminal confirmation. See "
":doc:`../topics/preview`."
msgstr ""
"默认值：``\"off\"``\\ 。本节点作为提供方时是否发送预览。取值为 ``off``\\ 、\\ ``on`` 和 "
"``with_reasoning``\\ 。通过 ``anet preview`` 设置；``with_reasoning`` "
"需在终端上确认。参见 :doc:`../topics/preview`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:95
msgid "``content_retention``"
msgstr "``content_retention``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:96
msgid ""
"Default: ``\"30d\"``. How long the node keeps the content of a task after"
" the task ends. Valid values are 1 to 3650 days written as ``<N>d``, or "
"``forever``. Calls to public capabilities keep their content for 7 days "
"regardless. Set with ``anet retention set``, which asks for confirmation."
msgstr ""
"默认值：``\"30d\"``\\ 。任务结束后节点保留任务内容的时间。有效值为写作 ``<N>d`` 的 1 至 3650 天，或 "
"``forever``\\ 。公开能力的调用无论如何只保留内容 7 天。通过 ``anet retention set`` "
"设置，该命令会请求确认。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:101
msgid "``without``"
msgstr "``without``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:102
msgid ""
"Default: not set. An array of module names that are switched off. A "
"listed module never starts, and the node handles its absence in the same "
"way as for a module that is not compiled in. Names must be known module "
"names and must not repeat; otherwise the file fails validation with "
"``config_invalid``. The key is edited in ``config.json`` or with ``anet "
"init --without`` (names are added, never removed) and ``anet init "
"--with`` (one name is removed). The control plane, MCP and the local A2A "
"interface have no way to write it. See :doc:`../topics/modules`."
msgstr ""
"默认值：未设置。被关闭的模块名称数组。列出的模块不会启动，节点处理其缺席的方式与未编译进来的模块相同。名称必须是已知的模块名称且不得重复；否则文件会以"
" ``config_invalid`` 校验失败。该键可在 ``config.json`` 中编辑，或通过 ``anet init "
"--without``\\ （添加名称，从不移除）和 ``anet init --with``\\ （移除一个名称）修改。控制平面、MCP 和本地"
" A2A 接口都无法写入它。参见 :doc:`../topics/modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:112
msgid "``inbound``"
msgstr "``inbound``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:114
msgid "``inbound.policy``"
msgstr "``inbound.policy``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:115
msgid ""
"Default: ``closed``. Which peers may send tasks. ``closed`` accepts tasks"
" only from peers on the allow list, ``approve`` holds tasks of other "
"peers until an operator approves them, and ``open`` accepts tasks from "
"anyone. Set with ``anet inbound policy``; loosening needs terminal "
"confirmation."
msgstr ""
"默认值：``closed``\\ 。哪些对端可以发送任务。\\ ``closed`` 只接受 allow "
"名单上的对端的任务，``approve`` 把其他对端的任务保留到运营人员批准，``open`` 接受任何人的任务。通过 ``anet "
"inbound policy`` 设置；放宽需在终端上确认。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:120
msgid ""
"The lists are the files ``peers.allow``, ``peers.trust`` and "
"``peers.deny`` in the data directory. They are managed with ``anet "
"peers``. The queue of tasks that wait for approval holds at most 200 "
"tasks, at most 3 per peer, for 72 hours. These are constants."
msgstr ""
"名单是数据目录中的文件 ``peers.allow``\\ 、\\ ``peers.trust`` 和 ``peers.deny``，通过 "
"``anet peers`` 管理。等待批准的任务队列最多容纳 200 个任务，每个对端最多 3 个，保留 72 小时。这些都是常量。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:125
msgid "``inbound.public_capabilities``"
msgstr "``inbound.public_capabilities``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:126
msgid ""
"Default: ``[]``. The capabilities that this node offers to peers, as an "
"array of objects. Each object has these keys."
msgstr "默认值：``[]``\\ 。本节点向对端提供的能力，为对象数组。每个对象具有以下键。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:133
#: ../../reference/config.rst:188
#: ../../reference/config.rst:272
msgid "Key"
msgstr "键"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:134
#: ../../reference/config.rst:189
#: ../../reference/config.rst:273
msgid "Default"
