#: ../../reference/config.rst:135
#: ../../reference/config.rst:190
#: ../../reference/config.rst:274
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:136
msgid "``id``"
msgstr "``id``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:138
msgid "Required. The capability identifier that callers use."
msgstr "必填。调用方使用的能力标识符。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:139
msgid "``per_caller_per_min``"
msgstr "``per_caller_per_min``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:140
msgid "60"
msgstr "60"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:141
msgid "Calls per caller and minute."
msgstr "每个调用方每分钟的调用次数。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:142
msgid "``per_caller_per_day``"
msgstr "``per_caller_per_day``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:143
msgid "2000"
msgstr "2000"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:144
msgid "Calls per caller and UTC day."
msgstr "每个调用方每个 UTC 日的调用次数。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:145
msgid "``global_per_min``"
msgstr "``global_per_min``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:146
msgid "1200"
msgstr "1200"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:147
msgid "Calls per minute from all callers."
msgstr "所有调用方每分钟的调用次数。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:148
msgid "``max_inflight``"
msgstr "``max_inflight``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:149
msgid "16"
msgstr "16"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:150
msgid "Calls running at the same time."
msgstr "同时运行的调用数。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:151
msgid "``per_caller_inflight``"
msgstr "``per_caller_inflight``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:152
msgid "1"
msgstr "1"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:153
msgid ""
"Calls of one caller running at the same time; at least 1 and at most "
"``max_inflight``."
msgstr "同一调用方同时运行的调用数；至少为 1，至多为 ``max_inflight``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:155
msgid "``max_args_bytes``"
msgstr "``max_args_bytes``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:156
msgid "4096"
msgstr "4096"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:157
msgid "Largest size of the arguments object."
msgstr "参数对象的最大大小。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:158
msgid "``files``"
msgstr "``files``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:159
msgid "none"
msgstr "无"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:160
msgid ""
"The files that a call may carry: ``count`` (1 to 8), ``max_bytes`` (1 "
"byte to 64 MiB) and ``types`` (at least one content type that the Go "
"function ``http.DetectContentType`` can detect). The capability must be "
"provided by the ``service`` module. The declared type of a file is not "
"trusted; the node detects the type from the content."
msgstr ""
"调用可以携带的文件：``count``\\ （1 至 8）、\\ ``max_bytes``\\ （1 字节至 64 MiB）和 "
"``types``\\ （至少一个 Go 函数 ``http.DetectContentType`` 能够检测的内容类型）。该能力必须由 "
"``service`` 模块提供。文件声明的类型不被信任；节点根据内容检测类型。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:165
msgid "``discard``"
msgstr "``discard``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:166
#: ../../reference/config.rst:171
msgid "``false``"
msgstr "``false``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:167
msgid ""
"The node does not keep the files of a call, and it clears the arguments "
"and the result when the task ends. This restricts only the storage of "
"``anet``, not the behavior of the backend program."
msgstr "节点不保留一次调用的文件，并在任务结束时清除参数和结果。这只限制 ``anet`` 的存储，不限制后端程序的行为。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:170
msgid "``allow_only``"
msgstr "``allow_only``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:172
msgid ""
"The capability is offered only to peers on the allow list or the trust "
"list. It does not appear on any card or registry entry that a hub can "
"read."
msgstr "该能力仅向 allow 名单或 trust 名单上的对端提供。它不会出现在 hub 可以读取的任何卡片或注册条目中。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:176
msgid ""
"The declaration of a capability is described in "
":doc:`../topics/capabilities`."
msgstr "能力的声明方式见 :doc:`../topics/capabilities`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:180
msgid "``auto_reply``"
msgstr "``auto_reply``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:182
msgid "The block is absent by default, which means that the auto-reply is off."
msgstr "该块默认不存在，表示自动回复关闭。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:191
msgid "``backend``"
msgstr "``backend``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:192
msgid "``openai``"
msgstr "``openai``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:193
msgid ""
"``exec`` starts a local coding agent, ``openai`` calls an OpenAI-"
"compatible API. Set with ``anet autoreply set --backend``."
msgstr ""
"``exec`` 启动本地编程 agent，``openai`` 调用兼容 OpenAI 的 API。通过 ``anet autoreply "
"set --backend`` 设置。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:195
msgid "``agent``"
msgstr "``agent``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:197
msgid ""
"Required for ``exec``: ``cursor``, ``claude``, ``codex``, ``opencode``, "
"``openclaw`` or ``hermes``."
msgstr ""
"``exec`` 必填：``cursor``\\ 、\\ ``claude``\\ 、\\ ``codex``\\ 、\\ "
"``opencode``\\ 、\\ ``openclaw`` 或 ``hermes``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:199
msgid "``untrusted``"
msgstr "``untrusted``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:200
msgid "``off``"
msgstr "``off``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:201
msgid ""
"``off`` or ``sandbox``. Whether tasks of peers that are not trusted are "
"answered, and in the sandbox."
msgstr "``off`` 或 ``sandbox``\\ 。是否应答不受信任的对端的任务，以及是否在沙箱中应答。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:203
msgid "``trusted``"
msgstr "``trusted``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:204
msgid "``direct``"
msgstr "``direct``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:205
msgid ""
"``direct`` runs the agent as the user of the node for trusted peers; "
"``sandbox`` runs it in the sandbox. Changing from ``sandbox`` to "
"``direct`` is confirmed on the terminal."
msgstr ""
"``direct`` 以节点用户的身份为受信任的对端运行 agent；``sandbox`` 在沙箱中运行。从 ``sandbox`` 改为 "
"``direct`` 需在终端上确认。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:208
msgid "``api_base``, ``model``, ``system_prompt``"
msgstr "``api_base``, ``model``, ``system_prompt``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:209
#: ../../reference/config.rst:213
msgid "empty"
msgstr "空"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:210
msgid ""
"Settings of the ``openai`` backend; ``model`` also overrides the model of"
" an ``exec`` agent."
msgstr "``openai`` 后端的设置；``model`` 同时覆盖 ``exec`` agent 的模型。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:212
msgid "``api_key``"
msgstr "``api_key``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:214
msgid ""
"Write-only. Set with ``--api-key-stdin``. The value is not shown by "
"``anet autoreply show``, the control plane or the logs."
msgstr "只写。通过 ``--api-key-stdin`` 设置。\\ ``anet autoreply show``\\ 、控制平面和日志都不显示该值。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:216
msgid "``work_dir``"
msgstr "``work_dir``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:217
msgid "a directory in the data directory"
msgstr "数据目录中的一个目录"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:218
msgid ""
"Working directory of runs in ``direct`` mode. An invalid path is reported"
" as ``work_dir_invalid``."
msgstr "``direct`` 模式下运行的工作目录。无效路径报告为 ``work_dir_invalid``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:220
msgid "``command``"
msgstr "``command``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:221
msgid "found on ``PATH``"
msgstr "在 ``PATH`` 中查找"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:222
msgid "Path of the agent program."
msgstr "agent 程序的路径。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:223
msgid "``extra_args``"
msgstr "``extra_args``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:224
#: ../../reference/config.rst:237
msgid "``[]``"
msgstr "``[]``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:225
msgid "Additional arguments for the agent program."
msgstr "传给 agent 程序的额外参数。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:226
msgid "``openclaw_agent``"
msgstr "``openclaw_agent``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:227
msgid "``main``"
msgstr "``main``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:228
msgid "The ``--agent`` value for ``openclaw``."
msgstr "``openclaw`` 的 ``--agent`` 值。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:229
msgid "``max_history``"
msgstr "``max_history``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:230
#: ../../reference/config.rst:242
msgid "20"
msgstr "20"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:231
msgid "Conversation turns sent to the backend."
msgstr "发送给后端的对话轮数。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:232
msgid "``api_timeout_seconds``"
msgstr "``api_timeout_seconds``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:233
msgid "180"
msgstr "180"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:234
msgid ""
"Timeout of one backend call. It is also the wall-clock limit of a run in "
"the sandbox."
msgstr "一次后端调用的超时。它同时是沙箱中一次运行的挂钟时间上限。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:236
msgid "``sandbox.egress_allow``"
msgstr "``sandbox.egress_allow``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:238
msgid ""
"Exact host names that sandboxed runs may reach on port 443 through "
"CONNECT. Every listed host is an outbound channel, so adding one is "
"confirmed on the terminal. See :doc:`../topics/sandbox`."
msgstr ""
"沙箱中的运行可以经 CONNECT 在 443 端口访问的确切主机名。列出的每个主机都是一条出站通道，因此添加主机需在终端确认。参见 "
":doc:`../topics/sandbox`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:241
msgid "``sandbox.runs_per_day``"
msgstr "``sandbox.runs_per_day``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:243
msgid ""
"Runs per local calendar day for peers that are not trusted. A value of 0 "
"means that no run is made for them; the task stays in the inbox. An "
"invalid value is reported as ``budget_invalid``."
msgstr ""
"不受信任的对端每个本地日历日的运行次数。值为 0 表示不为它们运行任何一次，任务留在收件箱中。无效值报告为 "
"``budget_invalid``\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:246
msgid "``sandbox.runs_per_peer_per_day``"
msgstr "``sandbox.runs_per_peer_per_day``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:247
msgid "5"
msgstr "5"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:248
msgid "The same limit for one peer."
msgstr "针对单个对端的同一限制。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:250
msgid ""
"The interval at which the daemon looks for tasks (5 seconds) and the cap "
"of 30 automatic messages per interaction are constants."
msgstr "守护进程查找任务的间隔（5 秒）以及每次交互 30 条自动消息的上限是常量。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:253
msgid ""
"Every write of the block is recorded as the evidence event "
"``anet.policy.changed``. The event names the key as a whole when its "
"summary differs, and there is one record for each audited field: "
"``auto_reply.trusted``, ``auto_reply.sandbox.egress_allow``, "
"``auto_reply.sandbox.runs_per_day``, "
"``auto_reply.sandbox.runs_per_peer_per_day`` and "
"``auto_reply.api_key_set``. Turning the block on or off is recorded in "
"the same way against the defaults. A block that is rejected is answered "
"with the sentence of the module (``config_invalid``, ``budget_invalid``, "
"``work_dir_invalid``, ``api_base_insecure`` or ``egress_allow_*``) and "
"status 400, and a conflict with the inbound policy with 409. A daemon "
"that finds an ``auto_reply`` block while the auto-reply module is not "
"available refuses to start (``module_absent.configured``)."
msgstr ""
"该块的每次写入都会记为证据事件 "
"``anet.policy.changed``。摘要不同时，事件记录整个键；每个被审计的字段另有一条记录：``auto_reply.trusted``、``auto_reply.sandbox.egress_allow``、``auto_reply.sandbox.runs_per_day``、``auto_reply.sandbox.runs_per_peer_per_day``"
" 与 "
"``auto_reply.api_key_set``。打开或关闭该块，按相对默认值的变化以同样方式记录。被拒绝的块以模块自己的句子（``config_invalid``、``budget_invalid``、``work_dir_invalid``、``api_base_insecure``"
" 或 ``egress_allow_*``）和状态 400 应答，与入站策略冲突则以 409 应答。自动回复模块不可用时，若发现 "
"``auto_reply`` 块，守护进程拒绝启动（``module_absent.configured``）。"

