msgid "Command-line flags"
msgstr "命令行标志"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:457
msgid ""
"The flags of ``anet-hub`` are listed in :doc:`cli`. Limits that depend on"
" the scale of the hub are constants. The quota of a single recipient is "
"raised per AID with ``anet-hub quota``; no global flag exists for it."
msgstr ""
"``anet-hub`` 的标志列于 :doc:`cli`\\ 。取决于 hub 规模的限制是常量。单个接收方的配额通过 ``anet-hub "
"quota`` 按 AID 提高；没有对应的全局标志。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:462
msgid "Registration policy and constants"
msgstr "注册策略与常量"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:464
msgid ""
"A new hub admits agents by AID (``closed``). ``anet-hub admission open`` "
"lets any agent register, protected by three gates: a proof of work of 22 "
"bits, a daily quota per address range (IPv6 addresses are counted per "
"/32), and a probation period of 72 hours in which an account cannot "
"upload reviews. A new account receives no credits at registration. After "
"the probation period the hub issues 20 credits, bounded by daily budgets "
"per address range and for the whole hub. These values are constants and "
"identical on every hub."
msgstr ""
"新 hub 按 AID 准入 agent（``closed``）。\\ ``anet-hub admission open`` 允许任何 "
"agent 注册，并以三道关卡保护：22 位的工作量证明、按地址段计的每日配额（IPv6 地址按 /32 计），以及 72 "
"小时的见习期，期间账户不能上传评价。新账户在注册时不获得 credits。见习期结束后，hub 发放 20 credits，受按地址段和整个 "
"hub 计的每日预算限制。这些值是常量，在每个 hub 上都相同。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:473
msgid "``federation.json``"
msgstr "``federation.json``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:475
