"``off`` or ``allowlist``. With ``allowlist`` the hub relays envelopes to "
"and from the listed peers."
msgstr "``off`` 或 ``allowlist``\\ 。使用 ``allowlist`` 时，hub 向所列对端中继信封，也从所列对端中继信封。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:494
msgid "``discovery``"
msgstr "``discovery``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:495
msgid ""
"``off`` or ``allowlist``. Switches independently of ``delivery``: a hub "
"may carry the traffic of a peer without publishing its directory to it."
msgstr "``off`` 或 ``allowlist``\\ 。与 ``delivery`` 独立切换：hub 可以承载对端的流量，而不向其发布自己的目录。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:498
msgid "``home``"
msgstr "``home``"

