msgid ""
"The public endpoint of this hub. It is sent as the routing hint on every "
"card that the hub serves."
msgstr "本 hub 的公开端点。它作为路由提示附在 hub 提供的每张卡片上。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:502
msgid "``peers``"
msgstr "``peers``"

