msgstr "``on``\\ （缺省时的默认值）或 ``off``\\ 。hub 是否固定其对端发行链的链头。该设置仅在列出了对端时才有效。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:511
msgid "See :doc:`../ops/federation`."
msgstr "参见 :doc:`../ops/federation`\\ 。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:515
msgid "ANetLink"
msgstr "ANetLink"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:517
msgid ""
"The program ``anetlinkd`` takes its settings with ``--config`` and has "
"these keys for the C1 interface."
msgstr "程序 ``anetlinkd`` 通过 ``--config`` 读取设置，并为 C1 接口提供以下键。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:520
msgid "``c1.socket`` (``--c1-socket``)"
msgstr "``c1.socket`` (``--c1-socket``)"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:521
msgid ""
"Default: ``$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/anetlink/c1.sock``, which is also the default"
" of ``modules.anetlink.socket``. Both sides connect without further "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"默认值：``$XDG_RUNTIME_DIR/anetlink/c1.sock``，同时也是 "
"``modules.anetlink.socket`` 的默认值。双方无需其他设置即可连接。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:524
msgid "``c1.allow_users`` (``--c1-allow-user``, repeatable)"
msgstr "``c1.allow_users``\\ （``--c1-allow-user``，可重复）"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:525
msgid ""
"Default: empty, which allows only the user of ``anetlinkd``. Required "
"when the daemon and ``anetlinkd`` run as different users."
msgstr "默认值：空，表示仅允许 ``anetlinkd`` 的用户。守护进程与 ``anetlinkd`` 以不同用户运行时必填。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:528
msgid "``c1.group`` (``--c1-group``)"
msgstr "``c1.group`` (``--c1-group``)"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:529
msgid "Default: not set. Required when more than one other user connects."
msgstr "默认值：未设置。多于一个其他用户连接时必填。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:531
msgid "``c1.remote``"
msgstr "``c1.remote``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:532
msgid "Default: empty, which refuses remote calls for all capabilities."
msgstr "默认值：空，表示对所有能力拒绝远程调用。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:537
msgid "Removed keys"
msgstr "已移除的键"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:539
msgid ""
"A removed key in ``config.json`` stops the daemon with "
"``config_key_removed``. This is not a migration. It prevents an old file "
"from being ignored without notice."
msgstr ""
"``config.json`` 中已移除的键会使守护进程以 ``config_key_removed`` "
"停止。这不是迁移，而是为了避免旧文件在不被察觉的情况下被忽略。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:546
msgid "Removed"
msgstr "已移除"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:547
msgid "Replacement"
msgstr "替代方式"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:548
msgid "``pricing``; ``payments.publish_prices``"
msgstr "``pricing``; ``payments.publish_prices``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:549
msgid "Prices are given only by the signed extended card. Remove the key."
msgstr "价格只由签名的扩展卡片给出。请移除该键。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:550
msgid "``modules.x402.voucher_addr``, ``voucher_url``"
msgstr "``modules.x402.voucher_addr``, ``voucher_url``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:551
msgid "The voucher gate is gone. Remove both."
msgstr "凭证关卡已取消。请两者都移除。"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:552
msgid "``modules.x402.witness_hub``, ``witness_every_seconds``"
msgstr "``modules.x402.witness_hub``, ``witness_every_seconds``"

#: ../../reference/config.rst:553
msgid "Balance checks run automatically. Remove both."
msgstr "余额检查自动运行。请两者都移除。"

